      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bruno%2C_Nebraska"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village was named after Brno, the capital of Bohemia, reflecting the Czech heritage of its early settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
